Z||000004||AusFiero||12-29-2001||01:16 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by GTFiero1:<BR><B>what is the car that Max gets at the end, the black supercharged one. i think its friggin awsome. i belive the cop cars are XB GT's<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Right first time. The police cars used in the movie are all Ford XB Falcons. The Black supercharged beast is a Ford XB GT Coupe with heaps of body modifications, powered by a 351 Cleveland. The supercharger was a fake for budgetry purposes. Plus how many superchargers turned on with a switch way back then.<P>Had a friend who was an extra in Mad Max 3.<P><P>------------------<BR>          <IMG SRC="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero/ausfiero5.gif">         <BR><A HREF="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero" TARGET=_blank>My Fiero</A> | <A HREF="http://www.fieroshop.com.au" TARGET=_blank>Fiero Accessories</A>||202.139.20.3||reg||1
